'''Cat Bros''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that was added in [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.0 Update|Patch 1.0.0]] of [[The Battle Cats Unite!]] It was used as promotional material to celebrate the Japanese release of The Battle Cats Unite! The window of availability was only during the first three months (December 20, 2018 - February 14, 2019) after the game's launch and would require players to clear [[Korea (Empire of Cats)|Korea]] from the [[Empire of Cats]]. Later on, it was reused as promotional content to celebrate the release of [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Versus Mode|Versus Mode]] and was part of the [https://youtu.be/o9TJK987Qrc Limited Edition The Battle Cats Unite Combo Case]. As of December 2021, a standalone physical version was distributed that contained a "Package Version Bonus" that is currently available '''<u>only</u>''' to '''Japanese''' and '''Southeast Asia''' versions.

